get.description:
Get a list of all configured notification providers.
The 'config' field varies by type:
- discord: {"webhook_url": "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/..."}

post.description:
Configure a new destination for backup alerts.
Supported types and configurations:
- discord: {"webhook_url": "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/..."}

put.description:
Update a notification provider's configuration by ID.
Supported types and configurations:
- discord: {"webhook_url": "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/..."}

get.description:
Get a list of all configured storage providers.
The 'config' field varies by type:
- local: {"path": "/tmp/backups"}
- s3: {"region": "us-east-1", "bucket": "...", "access_key": "...", "secret_key": "..."}

post.description:
Configure a new storage destination for backups.
Supported types and configurations:
- local: {"path": "/tmp/backups"}
- s3: {"region": "us-east-1", "bucket": "my-backups", "access_key": "...", "secret_key": "..."}

put.description:
Update a storage provider's configuration by ID.
Supported types and configurations:
- local: {"path": "/tmp/backups"}
- s3: {"region": "us-east-1", "bucket": "my-backups", "access_key": "...", "secret_key": "..."}
